// ============================================================================
// Stage 2 + Stage 3 Implementation: C-Extension Closure Roadmap (Eq 211)
// Replaces: sys (~341 stubs), posix (~174 stubs), time/marshal (~612 stubs)
//
// All functions are D-descriptors derived from ET primitives:
//   P (Point)      = platform substrate (hardware/OS)
//   D (Descriptor) = behavioral constraint on platform access
//   T (Traverser)  = syscall path / hardware bridge
//   E (Exception)  = grounded platform response
//
// Master Equation: P ∘ D ∘ T = E
//
// Architecture:
//   hardware_access ∘ "op_name" — routes through ETPL's native I/O kernel
//   sovereign_print ∘ x         — output descriptor (always available)
